            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述被匈奴留了十余年，张骞逃离后继续西行。大宛与康居的协助，终于把他带到了大月氏。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-2",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "当地协助者汉朝的使者，您到了。这里便是月氏如今生活的地方。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-question-life",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "migration",
              "text": "1询问：月氏为什么迁到这里？"
            },
            {
              "id": "daxia-relation",
              "text": "2询问：月氏与大夏是什么关系？"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞月氏来到这里，又与南边的大夏有什么关系？我想多了解一些。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-question-life",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "migration",
              "text": "1询问：月氏为什么迁到这里？"
            },
            {
              "id": "daxia-relation",
              "text": "2询问：月氏与大夏是什么关系？"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞月氏来到这里，又与南边的大夏有什么关系？我想多了解一些。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-migration",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "当地协助者月氏原先住在敦煌、祁连一带。被匈奴击败后，才远迁，经过大宛，来到西边。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-3",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞我奉汉廷之命而来。我们听闻月氏与匈奴的旧仇，希望能共同应对匈奴。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-4",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "当地协助者这里的人们已经在新的地方立足。您的来意，还需要让接见者听一听。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-5",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞先把汉廷的来意说清楚。走了这么久，我仍要完成这项使命。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "0",
            "line": "arrival-6",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "0",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述使者抵达了目的地。接下来，他要面对的，是已经改变的月氏处境。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-1",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞汉廷愿与月氏相通。匈奴曾给月氏带来深重伤害，我们希望找到共同的盟友。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-2",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "月氏接见者我们已经在新的地方生活。汉廷的来意，也要放在我们眼下的处境里谈。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-3",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "grievance",
              "text": "1询问：共同的旧仇，能否促成合作？"
            },
            {
              "id": "distance",
              "text": "2询问：汉朝的遥远，意味着什么？"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞我还想了解，你们会怎样考虑联合这件事。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-grievance",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "月氏接见者经历过迁徙，眼前的安定也有分量。过去的仇，并不意味着现在仍要为它出战。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-4",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞我明白，旧仇之外，你们还有如今要守护的生活。汉廷的期待，与这里的处境并不相同。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "1",
            "line": "meeting-5",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "1",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述《史记》以“地肥饶，少寇，志安乐，又自以远汉”解释月氏的处境。张骞在这一地区的活动中，终究未能取得期望的联合约定。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-1",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述目标未成，故事却没有在一次接见后结束。张骞由月氏到大夏，在这一区域停留一年多。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-2",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞来到这里，才知道每个地方都有自己的生活。我还要看清，他们怎样往来，又与哪些地方相通。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-question-region",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "yuezhi-life",
              "text": "1询问：月氏怎样安排生活？"
            },
            {
              "id": "daxia-life",
              "text": "2询问：大夏的人们怎样居住生活？"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞月氏与大夏的生活，有哪些不同？"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-yuezhi-life",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "当地协助者月氏有随畜迁移的生活习惯，人们和牲畜一起移动。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-3",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "当地协助者两地各有自己的生活。要了解它们与外界的往来，还可以留意市场上的物品。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-4",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞去看看那些物品。它们也许能告诉我，这片土地与外面的世界如何相连。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "2",
            "line": "waiting-5",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "2",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述翻到下一页，我们读到张骞在大夏的见物与答问。月氏接见与大夏见物，属于不同的叙事空间；市场见闻的确切日期不详。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-1",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述在大夏，张骞看见了邛竹杖和蜀布。遥远的市场里，出现了来自汉地的物品。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-2",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "cloth",
              "text": "1问蜀布的来处。"
            },
            {
              "id": "bamboo",
              "text": "2问邛竹杖的来处。"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞这些物品，是从哪里来的？"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-cloth",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "大夏答问者您认出的是蜀布，来自蜀地的布。它也出现在我们大夏的货物之中。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-3",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "大夏答问者我们的商人，从身毒购得这些物品。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-question-shendu",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "shendu-direction",
              "text": "1询问：身毒在大夏的什么方向？"
            },
            {
              "id": "shendu-life",
              "text": "2询问：身毒的生活和风土怎样？"
            }
          ],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞商人既然从身毒购得这些物品，我想再问问那个地方。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-shendu-direction",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "大夏答问者据说在大夏东南，约数千里。我们的商人往那里购货。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-4",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "张骞把这些见物和听来的消息放在一起，或许可以从蜀地寻找另一条通往身毒、大夏的路。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-5",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述这是张骞由见物与答问产生的道路推想，并非已经走通的新路线；他并未亲至身毒。联合目标未成，新的认识却在观察中展开。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": false,
          "book": {
            "complete": "false",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-6",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
          "prototypeMounted": false,
          "text": "记述后来，张骞历经归途波折回到汉朝，报告了西域诸国的亲历与传闻。这一段故事，停在他对世界的认识正在扩展的时刻。"
        },
        {
          "atlas": true,
          "book": {
            "complete": "true",
            "furthest": "3",
            "line": "market-6",
            "loadedImages": "3",
            "ready": "true",
            "scene": "3",
            "turning": "false"
          },
          "choices": [],
          "loadedScripts": [
            "http://127.0.0.1:5194/assets/yuezhi-Zb7oxvgt.js"
          ],
